      "message": "If vendors have customized struct mmc_host, that would make their modules incompatible with GKI anyway, since mmc_core is built-in to GKI.  If you need per-host fields or bits in your driver, you need to put them in the driver-specific host structure like \u0027struct sdhci_msm_host\u0027.",
